{"uid":"1a56a474909129e4","name":"test_exhaustion_without_a_run_handle_refuses_and_touches_no_wave_file","fullName":"tests.test_petitions#test_exhaustion_without_a_run_handle_refuses_and_touches_no_wave_file","historyId":"b782aff36f63d979ecc08679fa4fc715","time":{"start":1791919169242,"stop":1791919169246,"duration":4},"description":"Task 008 (requirement H), merged into one function (cure-01-04,\n    #204: consolidated from three separate test functions to bring the\n    fast tier's collected-test count back under its 5,800 launch ceiling;\n    every assertion below is unchanged, only merged into one body). The\n    wave-scoping logic this test used to exercise\n    (`ensure_petitions_file`/`_current_wave_petitions_path`, task 018)\n    only ever ran on the workspace-fallback branch of\n    `file_exhaustion_petition`, taken when the caller has no run handle --\n    exactly the branch requirement H retires outright. Every REAL caller\n    (`LoopSupervisor._verify_task`) always has a run handle\n    (`tests/test_petitioned_status_routing.py` covers that path); a\n    caller with none now gets a refusal and creates NOTHING under\n    `artifacts/reports/` -- no new current-wave file, and every pre-\n    existing older-wave file byte-for-byte unchanged, whether there are\n    several older-wave files, an older-plus-current pair, or a single\n    lone older-wave file.\n\n    Part 1 -- several older-wave files, no current-wave one yet.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 008 (requirement H), merged into one function (cure-01-04,<br />\n#204: consolidated from three separate test functions to bring the<br />\nfast tier's collected-test count back under its 5,800 launch ceiling;<br />\nevery assertion below is unchanged, only merged into one body). The<br />\nwave-scoping logic this test used to exercise<br />\n(<code>ensure_petitions_file</code>/<code>_current_wave_petitions_path</code>, task 018)<br />\nonly ever ran on the workspace-fallback branch of<br />\n<code>file_exhaustion_petition</code>, taken when the caller has no run handle --<br />\nexactly the branch requirement H retires outright. Every REAL caller<br />\n(<code>LoopSupervisor._verify_task</code>) always has a run handle<br />\n(<code>tests/test_petitioned_status_routing.py</code> covers that path); a<br />\ncaller with none now gets a refusal and creates NOTHING under<br />\n<code>artifacts/reports/</code> -- no new current-wave file, and every pre-<br />\nexisting older-wave file byte-for-byte unchanged, whether there are<br />\nseveral older-wave files, an older-plus-current pair, or a single<br />\nlone older-wave file.</p>\n<pre><code>Part 1 -- several older-wave files, no current-wave one yet.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791919169232,"stop":1791919169232,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791919169233,"stop":1791919169235,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791919169236,"stop":1791919169236,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791919169236,"stop":1791919169239,"duration":3},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path","time":{"start":17919191692